=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Chipmy-Popmy} to begin this quest.
* Hop aboard the {z:Manaclipper} in {p:Bibiki Bay} to {p:Bibiki Bay - Purgonorgo Isle}.
* Head to (H-9) to find a **???**.
* Examine the **???** to spawn 6 {m:Peerifools|Peerifool}.
